Design and procedure

This experimental study was conducted as a within-subject 2 × 2 × 2 factorial design. The three independent variables are the HMI, ISA warnings, and the 1-back task. Each of these three factors has two levels. The two levels of HMI are driving with the conventional speedometer and driving with the ecological speedometer. The two levels of ISA warnings are that the ISA is either on or off. Lastly, the 1-back task was used to either add workload or not. A graphic representation of the study
